{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"XBMCFoundation.Kodi","latestVersion":"21.3.0.0","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.9d4770b9.png","priority":1,"sha256":"9d4770b989c663e00289df57d1f16940bf2109574acce920c84e697452e173c2","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"A free and feature-rich media center for various operating systems, consoles and TVs. With Kodi you can manage and play movies, photos and music.","license":"GPL-2.0-or-later","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/xbmc/xbmc/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.md","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-GB":{"description":"A free and feature-rich media centre for various operating systems, consoles and TVs. With Kodi you can manage and play films, photos and music.","locale":"en-GB","longDescription":"Kodi is a free and open source media player application developed by the Kodi Foundation, a non-profit technology consortium. Kodi is available for multiple operating-systems and hardware platforms, featuring a living room-scale user interface for use with tellies and remote controls. It allows users to play and view most videos, music, podcasts, and other digital media files from local and network storage media and the internet.","tags":["9nblggh4t892","films","media","media-centre","movies","music","photos","pvr","series","shows","television","telly","tv","videos","xbmc"]},"en-US":{"description":"A free and feature-rich media center for various operating systems, consoles and TVs. With Kodi you can manage and play movies, photos and music.","license":"GPL-2.0-or-later","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/xbmc/xbmc/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.md","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Kodi is a free and open source media player application developed by the Kodi Foundation, a non-profit technology consortium. Kodi is available for multiple operating-systems and hardware platforms, featuring a 10-foot user interface for use with televisions and remote controls. It allows users to play and view most videos, music, podcasts, and other digital media files from local and network storage media and the internet.","moniker":"kodi","name":"Kodi","packageUrl":"https://kodi.tv/download/windows/","publisher":"XBMC Foundation","publisherUrl":"https://kodi.tv/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://kodi.tv/article/kodi-21-3-omega-release/","tags":["9nblggh4t892","films","media","media-center","movies","music","photos","pvr","series","shows","television","tv","videos","xbmc"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"Kodi 是一款免费且功能丰富的媒体中心，适用于各种操作系统、游戏机和电视。通过 Kodi，您可以管理和播放电影、照片和音乐。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Kodi 是由非营利技术联盟 Kodi 基金会开发的一款免费开源媒体播放器应用程序。Kodi 适用于多种操作系统和硬件平台，具有 10 英尺用户界面，可与电视机和遥控器配合使用。它允许用户播放和观看本地、网络存储媒体和互联网上的大多数视频、音乐、播客和其它数字媒体文件。","tags":["pvr","xbmc","媒体","媒体中心","游戏","照片","电影","电视","电视剧","直播","综艺","视频","连续剧","音乐"]}},"longDescription":"Kodi is a free and open source media player application developed by the Kodi Foundation, a non-profit technology consortium. Kodi is available for multiple operating-systems and hardware platforms, featuring a 10-foot user interface for use with televisions and remote controls. It allows users to play and view most videos, music, podcasts, and other digital media files from local and network storage media and the internet.","moniker":"kodi","name":"Kodi","packageUrl":"https://kodi.tv/download/windows/","publisher":"XBMC Foundation","publisherUrl":"https://kodi.tv/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://kodi.tv/article/kodi-21-3-omega-release/","tags":["9nblggh4t892","films","media","media-center","movies","music","photos","pvr","series","shows","television","tv","videos","xbmc"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/21.3.0.0/app.json","detailSha256":"a9b9f903986817c3bc5af4f5c7358e8262d8551c9a3f49945591aacdfc6b0a42","releaseDate":"2025-11-23","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"21.3.0.0"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/21.2.0.0/app.json","detailSha256":"1485c6e63f911